  - philosophy
  - architecture
body: |-
  ## 1. Shared Knowledge Banks (Megaman Compendium)

  ### Concept-Level Abstraction
  Not raw snippets — universal PRINCIPLES with language-specific leaves:
  ```
  Concept: timing-safe-comparison (universal)
    → TypeScript: crypto.timingSafeEqual()
    → Rust: constant_time_eq::constant_time_eq()
    → Python: hmac.compare_digest()
  ```
  Merging works at concept level, not snippet level.

  ### Why Small Models Can Leverage This
  Without compendium: model must DERIVE solution (requires reasoning, parameters, GPU)
  With compendium: model must FOLLOW RECIPE (requires instruction-following only)
  Perfect context turns "solve this" into "execute this" — scales down to 7B models.

  ### Training Signal Potential
  N developers × ~100 entries × confidence + applied-count + outcomes = practitioner-verified, outcome-tracked training data. Not web scraping — distilled experience.

  ## 2. Knowledge Scan — Automated Expertise Extraction

  ### Three Phases
  - `paradigm scan --deep`: What exists (syntactic, already partially works)
  - `paradigm scan --learn`: What it means (semantic — Opus fleet extracts patterns)
  - `paradigm scan --plan`: What to watch (monitors based on patterns + planned work)

  ### Multi-Agent Fleet
  Structure agent, Pattern agent, Security agent, Test agent, Data agent — parallel scan, shared report, orchestrator merge.

  ### Monitors → Aspects → Hooks
  Detected patterns become monitors (agent-level). Stable monitors graduate to aspects. Enforceable aspects graduate to hooks. The leveling framework applied to codebase understanding.

  ## 3. Portable Agent State

  ### Git-native sync (Phase 1 — simplest)
  ~/.paradigm/ as git repo → private GitHub backing store → paradigm sync push/pull

  ### Privacy architecture
  - Full local works without network (default)
  - Selective sharing: opt-in, per-entry, with anonymization
  - Anonymized entries strip project names, paths, business logic
  - Revocation: unpublish anytime

  ### Multi-machine workflow
  sync pull → work → agents accumulate → sync push → next machine pulls → same agents, full expertise

  ## Key Principle
  The compendium IS the intelligence. The model is just the executor. That's not limitation — that's democratization.
